**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      READ INPUT DATA SUBROUTINE                                    *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   IT IS THE PURPOSE OF THE READ INPUT DATA SUBROUTINE TO
*            HANDLE DATA SENT TO THE LVDC/LVDA VIA THE FOURTEEN
*            RCA-110A INPUT LINES.

* ENTRIES    RIS      ENTERED FROM VERIFY AND PREPARE TO LOAD

       ORG     VPLD,D.DATA

RISRT  BSS     1
RISDT  BSS     1
RISCMD BSS     1
RISTAT BSS     1

RIS    STO     777          ENTER FROM CALL RT                        B
       CLA     777
       STO     RISRT

       CLA     V.STAT
       STO     RISTAT

RIS1   CLA     D.KZRO       INITIALIZE TO OBTAIN DELTA TIME           B
       STO     RISDT
       PIO     103
       STO     775

RIS2   PIO     057
       AND     D.KB23       IS SYNC ON                                Q
       TNZ     RIS3                                                   Y
       
       HOP     ATS          ABORT TEST                                P

       HOP     RTS          REAL TIME DELTA                           P
       ADD     RISDT        UPDATE DELTA TIME                         B
       STO     RISDT

       SUB     =(256000.0*P.CMSR) HAVE 256 SECONDS ELAPSED YET?       Q
       TMI     RIS2                                                   N

       CLA     =O45
       HOP     ISS          ISSUE OVERTIME STATUS CODE                P
       TRA     RIS1

RIS3   PIO     043          READ IN RCA-110A INPUT DATA               I
       AND     =O77776
       STO     RISCMD

       HOP     SRS          SYNC RESET                                P

       CLA     RISCMD       IS INPUT DATA                             Q
       TMI     RIS5                                                   N

       CLA     RISTAT
       SUB     V.STAT
       TNZ     *+2
       TRA     RIS4

       CLA     RISTAT       RE-ESTABLISH STATUS CODE OF CALLING PGM
       HOP     ISS

RIS4   CLA     RISCMD       PLACE RCA-110A DATA IN ACCUMULATOR        B
       HOP     RISRT        HOP ON HOP SV                             X

RIS5   CLA     RISCMD
       STO     V.EMR
       CLA     RIEM1        INPUT IS MODE                             B
       HOP     EMSR         ERROR MESSAGE                             P

       CLA     RISTAT
       SUB     =O12         IS PREPARE TO LAUNCH INDICATED?           Q
       TNZ     *+2          
       HOP     MDSRT        FIXME: THIS SHOULD GO TO PTL 
       HOP     MDSRT        EXIT TO MODE SORT                         X
